%% W1D4 — Model Context Protocol (MCP) Intro — Session Lifecycle & Tool Call Flow
%% Shows: full MCP session from initialisation through tool call with error branch

sequenceDiagram
    %% W1D4 — MCP Session Lifecycle and Tool Invocation
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Host as Host Application
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Server as MCP Server (CRM)
    participant CRM as Salesforce API

    User->>Host: Submit query: "What is the status of account CUST-8823?"
    Host->>Client: Start MCP session

    Note over Client,Server: Phase 1 — Initialisation
    Client->>Server: initialize {protocolVersion: "2024-11-05", capabilities: {}}
    Server-->>Client: {capabilities: {tools: {}, resources: {}}, serverInfo: {name: "crm-server"}}

    Note over Client,Server: Phase 2 — Capability Discovery
    Client->>Server: tools/list {}
    Server-->>Client: [{name: "lookup_account", description: "...", inputSchema: {...}}]
    Client->>Host: Register tool schemas in context

    Note over Host: Phase 3 — LLM Reasoning
    Host->>Host: LLM selects tool: lookup_account\nGenerates args: {customer_id: "CUST-8823", account_region: "us-east-1"}

    Note over Client,Server: Phase 4 — Tool Execution
    Client->>Server: tools/call {name: "lookup_account", arguments: {customer_id: "CUST-8823", account_region: "us-east-1"}}
    Server->>Server: Validate input against JSON Schema
    Server->>CRM: GET /accounts/CUST-8823?region=us-east-1\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>

    alt CRM responds successfully
        CRM-->>Server: {status: "active", tier: "gold", balance: 0}
        Server-->>Client: {content: [{type: "text", text: "..."}], isError: false}
        Client-->>Host: Tool result delivered
        Host-->>User: "Account CUST-8823 is active, tier: gold, balance: $0"
    else CRM returns error or validation fails
        CRM-->>Server: 422 Missing required field: account_region
        Server-->>Client: {content: [{type: "text", text: "CRM error: missing account_region"}], isError: true}
        Note over Client,Host: isError:true returned — LLM can reason about failure
        Client-->>Host: Tool error delivered
        Host-->>User: "I could not retrieve account details. Please verify the account region and try again."
    end

    Note over Client,Server: Phase 5 — Clean Shutdown
    Client->>Server: Session closed (transport closed)
